1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
"Echo Of A Letter"
(Episode 6)

2
00:00:22,399 --> 00:00:23,399
Wan.

3
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:24,480
You're awake.

4
00:00:26,199 --> 00:00:26,839
Xuan.

5
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,600
Did you bring me to the hospital?

6
00:00:36,719 --> 00:00:37,719
Mr. Zhao.

7
00:00:41,039 --> 00:00:42,079
What are you doing here?

8
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:47,160
Zhao Shengge found you
by the road and saved you.

9
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:50,200
Ms. Xu said you saved her.

10
00:00:51,439 --> 00:00:52,439
That gang...

11
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:54,320
They're probably from White Crane Hall.

12
00:00:56,039 --> 00:00:57,119
Are you feeling any better?

13
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:03,680
Were they armed with guns?

14
00:01:09,879 --> 00:01:11,438
I don't think they had guns,

15
00:01:11,439 --> 00:01:13,119
but they were definitely carrying weapons.

16
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:15,798
The trunks of both Jeep A67s

17
00:01:15,799 --> 00:01:17,120
were riding low.

18
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:18,760
Stock models.

19
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:20,079
No license plates.

20
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:24,280
Vehicles like that are usually
used for illegal border crossings.

21
00:01:24,799 --> 00:01:26,599
You certainly remember
those details clearly.

22
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:28,399
How bad is your hand?

23
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:29,400
Does your head hurt?

24
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:31,760
Much better.

25
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:32,840
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

26
00:01:33,079 --> 00:01:33,760
Chen Wan.

27
00:01:33,959 --> 00:01:34,999
They were coming after me.

28
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:36,960
Since you got dragged into this,

29
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:38,958
I owe you my thanks and compensation.

30
00:01:38,959 --> 00:01:39,959
That's not necessary.

31
00:01:40,695 --> 00:01:41,656
Ms. Xu already gave me—

32
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:42,319
That's on her part.

33
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:43,360
This is a separate matter.

34
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,200
Excuse me.

35
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:51,239
Hello?

36
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:52,400
Where's Chen Wan?

37
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:53,480
I want to see Chen Wan!

38
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,640
How are you feeling?

39
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:04,920
Mr. Tan.

40
00:02:05,079 --> 00:02:06,079
I'm fine.

41
00:02:06,159 --> 00:02:07,920
Just some soft tissue bruising.

42
00:02:08,719 --> 00:02:10,679
The doctor insisted on
keeping me for a few days,

43
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,680
worried it might be a concussion.

44
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:14,839
I knew Zhixuan was full of it.

45
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:15,840
I was not!

46
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,040
He does have a concussion!

47
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,520
He's not even thinking straight!

48
00:02:18,919 --> 00:02:20,280
Just look at his face right now.

49
00:02:20,879 --> 00:02:21,999
He's practically disfigured.

50
00:02:22,319 --> 00:02:23,319
I'm really fine.

51
00:02:25,919 --> 00:02:27,039
That does look pretty rough.

52
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:27,960
Tell you what.

53
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:28,960
You get some good rest.

54
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,159
Once you're discharged,

55
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:31,840
I'll throw you a welcome-back party.

56
00:02:32,199 --> 00:02:33,199
Okay.

57
00:02:34,159 --> 00:02:35,159
Chen Wan,

58
00:02:35,319 --> 00:02:36,120
do you have any idea

59
00:02:36,121 --> 00:02:37,441
who you risked your life to save?

60
00:02:38,159 --> 00:02:39,639
Zhao Shengge's fiancée.

61
00:02:40,599 --> 00:02:41,919
They messed with the wrong guy.

62
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:44,015
Zhao Shengge won't let
them get away with this.

63
00:02:44,039 --> 00:02:45,159
Fiancée?

64
00:02:45,879 --> 00:02:46,879
Did you arrange that?

65
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,336
Who would dare arrange
anything for you, Zhao Shengge?

66
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:52,096
It was right there in
the Haidu Evening Post.

67
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:54,960
"Financial tycoon Zhao Shengge and
the eldest daughter of the Xu family

68
00:02:55,319 --> 00:02:56,918
spotted heading to Shallow Water Gardens

69
00:02:56,919 --> 00:02:58,199
to build their love nest."

70
00:02:58,599 --> 00:02:59,719
Did you write that yourself?

71
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:01,840
Huadu News reported it too.

72
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:04,279
You two were seen having dinner at Sifden.

73
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,280
See? Look at that.

74
00:03:05,879 --> 00:03:07,119
Everyone knows about it.

75
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,399
I'm not the only one who saw it.

76
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,400
Right?

77
00:03:09,879 --> 00:03:11,559
The whole world knows.

78
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:12,919
I didn't make this up.

79
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:15,440
Since when does having
dinner mean getting engaged?

80
00:03:16,199 --> 00:03:17,919
Ms. Xu and I are not getting engaged.

81
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:21,359
However, I do reserve the right to
sue both of you and those tabloids

82
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:23,400
for invading my privacy
and spreading false rumors.

83
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:28,360
What?

84
00:03:28,919 --> 00:03:29,919
Did you read it too?

85
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:32,840
No.

86
00:03:33,199 --> 00:03:33,800
I didn't.

87
00:03:33,801 --> 00:03:35,199
Whether it's true or not,

88
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:37,120
this whole mess happened
because of you two.

89
00:03:37,599 --> 00:03:39,439
You need to take
responsibility, Zhao Shengge.

90
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:40,960
Chen Wan,

91
00:03:41,159 --> 00:03:42,039
milk him for all he's worth.

92
00:03:42,039 --> 00:03:43,039
You deserve it.

93
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:46,840
I need a family member to sign this.

94
00:03:46,841 --> 00:03:47,961
Who is the patient's family?

95
00:03:48,479 --> 00:03:49,479
I'll do it.

96
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:57,000
Let me tell you,

97
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,198
Ms. Xu, she—

98
00:03:58,199 --> 00:03:59,199
Alright.

99
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,440
Let's not disturb Wan's rest.

100
00:04:00,639 --> 00:04:01,639
We should get going.

101
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,360
Thank you.

102
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:42,040
Does the IV site hurt?

103
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:43,800
No, it doesn't.

104
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,240
This isn't an engagement ring.

105
00:04:48,439 --> 00:04:49,720
It bears the Zhao family crest.

106
00:04:51,439 --> 00:04:53,480
Everything in the papers is nonsense.

107
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:55,878
Minglong and Baisheng
don't need a marriage alliance

108
00:04:55,879 --> 00:04:57,559
to make the Lai Chi Wun project a success.

109
00:04:58,199 --> 00:04:59,838
You don't need to explain
all this to me, Mr. Zhao.

110
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:00,839
Yes, I do.

111
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:06,480
Are you afraid of me?

112
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:09,639
No.

113
00:05:09,639 --> 00:05:10,639
You're not?

114
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,000
No.

115
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:15,720
Good.

116
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,960
There's no need to be afraid of me.

117
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:22,160
Chen Wan,

118
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,600
don't be afraid of me.

119
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:36,800
The doctor suggested
you stay a few more days.

120
00:05:37,639 --> 00:05:39,799
I'll just stay tonight for observation.

121
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:41,239
If nothing comes up today, I'll—

122
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,439
Listen to the doctor.

123
00:05:42,959 --> 00:05:44,279
Stop trying to diagnose yourself.

124
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:46,079
If I station a few men

125
00:05:46,879 --> 00:05:48,000
outside your room,

126
00:05:48,439 --> 00:05:49,439
will that bother you?

127
00:05:51,199 --> 00:05:52,240
Those desperate thugs...

128
00:05:52,519 --> 00:05:53,519
Before they're caught,

129
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:55,960
it's very likely they'll come
back to retaliate against you.

130
00:05:56,319 --> 00:05:58,040
I want my men here keeping an eye on you.

131
00:06:00,199 --> 00:06:00,720
Okay.

132
00:06:00,721 --> 00:06:02,641
I'll also hire someone
else to take care of you.

133
00:06:03,199 --> 00:06:04,000
Wouldn't that be—

134
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,000
Or,

135
00:06:05,759 --> 00:06:07,600
just consider it a favor I owe you for now.

136
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:09,480
Once you figure out what you want,

137
00:06:09,959 --> 00:06:10,959
you can tell me anytime.

138
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,240
Chen Wan.

139
00:06:16,399 --> 00:06:17,776
The patient has a weak constitution.

140
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:19,800
A head injury like this is
very dangerous for him.

141
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:21,359
He shouldn't lie flat for too long.

142
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:23,000
Please elevate the head of his bed a bit.

143
00:07:14,639 --> 00:07:17,199
Mr. Zhao, won't being away
for so long affect your schedule?

144
00:07:17,959 --> 00:07:19,398
If you have things to attend to,

145
00:07:19,399 --> 00:07:20,438
you should head back.

146
00:07:20,439 --> 00:07:21,439
It's fine.

147
00:07:21,959 --> 00:07:23,959
I only needed to make a
brief appearance on stage.

148
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:26,360
Things like giving lectures,

149
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:28,319
making speeches,

150
00:07:28,879 --> 00:07:29,879
or mingling with guests—

151
00:07:30,279 --> 00:07:31,519
I don't have to do any of that.

152
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:33,399
If you're tired, get some rest.

153
00:07:34,399 --> 00:07:35,679
Once Zhixuan gets here,

154
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:36,680
I'll leave.

155
00:07:39,279 --> 00:07:40,279
Okay.

156
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,040
It's raining outside.

157
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,160
Remember to take an umbrella.

158
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,040
Don't worry.

159
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:48,920
I have one in my car.

160
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:50,480
Go to sleep.

161
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:52,600
Okay.

162
00:09:23,399 --> 00:09:24,399
Wan.

163
00:09:33,919 --> 00:09:34,919
Something came up.

164
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:35,679
I have to go.

165
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,000
Hold on, Zhao Shengge.

166
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:40,480
He's asleep?

167
00:09:40,639 --> 00:09:41,639
Yes.

168
00:09:42,879 --> 00:09:44,600
He actually fell asleep

169
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:46,159
right in front of you?

170
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:50,520
Thanks for looking after him.

171
00:09:51,399 --> 00:09:52,839
Call the nurse when his IV runs out.

172
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:56,080
Zhuo Zhixuan.

173
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:58,919
Call the nurse before the IV runs out.

174
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,760
Let me know if anything comes up.

175
00:10:02,639 --> 00:10:03,639
I'm leaving.

176
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:13,279
Is that really Zhao Shengge?

177
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:16,919
Viola.

178
00:10:16,919 --> 00:10:17,519
Yes, Mr. Zhao?

179
00:10:17,679 --> 00:10:19,320
Have Mrs. Zhang go to Renji Hospital

180
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:20,559
to care for a patient for a few days.

181
00:10:20,559 --> 00:10:21,559
Right away, Mr. Zhao.

182
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:25,440
Tell her to make plenty of nutritious soup,

183
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:27,440
and give her a generous bonus.

184
00:10:28,639 --> 00:10:29,639
Also,

185
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:32,159
I need regular updates
on the patient's recovery.

186
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:34,440
Have her take some photos
when she has the chance.

187
00:10:34,639 --> 00:10:35,200
Understood.

188
00:10:35,559 --> 00:10:38,336
Make sure she doesn't make the
patient uncomfortable while taking them.

189
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:39,360
Got it.

190
00:10:41,039 --> 00:10:42,039
Bozhu.

191
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:44,240
Eat slowly.

192
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,479
Take your time, buddy.

193
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,599
Is the canned food good?

194
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:47,839
We got really lucky today.

195
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:48,919
It hasn't expired yet.

196
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:50,279
Eat slowly.

197
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:51,039
Take your time.

198
00:10:51,039 --> 00:10:51,759
Slow down.

199
00:10:51,759 --> 00:10:52,360
No rush.

200
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:53,600
Eat slowly.

201
00:10:54,799 --> 00:10:55,840
Look at you.

202
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:58,639
Isn't that canned food too salty for him?

203
00:10:59,279 --> 00:11:00,080
S-Sir,

204
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:00,919
we'll leave right away.

205
00:11:00,919 --> 00:11:01,919
We're leaving right now.

206
00:11:02,440 --> 00:11:03,440
It's you.

207
00:11:04,559 --> 00:11:06,159
Shh, quiet down.

208
00:11:06,559 --> 00:11:07,559
Don't worry.

209
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:09,360
I have a puppy too.

210
00:11:09,960 --> 00:11:10,960
His name is Bozhu.

211
00:11:11,879 --> 00:11:13,120
He loves canned food,

212
00:11:14,039 --> 00:11:16,840
but if he eats too much, his fur falls out.

213
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:19,440
We rarely eat this stuff.

214
00:11:19,799 --> 00:11:22,279
If Bozhu loses his fur
from eating too much,

215
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:26,038
will it grow back if he eats less?

216
00:11:26,039 --> 00:11:27,720
It'll grow back very quickly.

217
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,200
And after that,

218
00:11:29,799 --> 00:11:31,320
he'll stay healthy forever.

219
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:35,678
Well, we'll get out of your way, sir.

220
00:11:35,679 --> 00:11:36,519
We're leaving right now.

221
00:11:36,520 --> 00:11:37,760
I'm not here to chase you away.

222
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:40,480
A friend of mine is sick.

223
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:42,560
I came to the hospital to visit him.

224
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,600
Go on and play.

225
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,320
Come here.

226
00:11:52,639 --> 00:11:53,639
Hey.

227
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:17,360
Young Master,

228
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:19,360
the Master sent me to
take you to your lessons.

229
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:35,360
How about I call you Bozhu?

230
00:12:50,559 --> 00:12:51,320
Lucas.

231
00:12:51,559 --> 00:12:52,039
Mr. Zhao.

232
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:53,320
At the shooting club,

233
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:55,160
that little boy I asked you to look into...

234
00:12:56,399 --> 00:12:57,639
The boy from the parking lot?

235
00:12:58,039 --> 00:12:58,639
Yes.

236
00:12:58,879 --> 00:13:00,559
The one collecting bottles.

237
00:13:01,559 --> 00:13:03,440
Set up a discreet fundraising plan for him.

238
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:05,919
Should the donation be made in your name?

239
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:07,360
No.

240
00:13:08,639 --> 00:13:09,879
Keep my name off of it.

241
00:13:10,919 --> 00:13:11,919
Understood.

242
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:34,879
I must be losing my mind.

243
00:15:50,529 --> 00:15:53,449
[Information about post-surgery basic
monitoring requirements]

244
00:16:19,960 --> 00:16:21,159
His head...

245
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:23,679
It's really so round.

246
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:39,360
Mr. Zhao.

247
00:16:43,159 --> 00:16:44,159
Hold on.

248
00:16:45,559 --> 00:16:46,559
Hello?

249
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:50,600
The soup...

250
00:16:52,279 --> 00:16:53,279
It's nutritious.

251
00:16:54,840 --> 00:16:56,400
Whether he eats it or not is up to him.

252
00:16:57,279 --> 00:16:58,599
If he doesn't want it, forget it.

253
00:16:58,840 --> 00:16:59,840
Leave it to him.

254
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:04,480
Who was that?

255
00:17:05,359 --> 00:17:06,359
My housekeeper.

256
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:07,920
Did something happen?

257
00:17:08,559 --> 00:17:10,039
She recently took in a kitten.

258
00:17:10,240 --> 00:17:11,240
It's refusing to eat.

259
00:17:12,359 --> 00:17:13,879
Is that some kind of new deadpan joke?

260
00:17:22,200 --> 00:17:23,879
We're heading to the hospital to visit Wan.

261
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:25,719
Xuan is helping him bid
on a painting in Beidao.

262
00:17:25,743 --> 00:17:27,246
We're meeting up at the hospital.
Are you coming?

263
00:17:27,271 --> 00:17:27,883
[A legal contract
for development]

264
00:17:30,279 --> 00:17:31,279
I'll pass.

265
00:17:31,559 --> 00:17:33,439
I have to go back to
the family estate tonight.

266
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:35,896
The old man has been hounding
me the past couple of days.

267
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:40,023
He probably wants to interrogate me
about what happened at the launch ceremony.

268
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:41,720
Fine.

269
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:42,920
Still,

270
00:17:43,480 --> 00:17:45,240
when it comes to Chen
Wan's discharge party,

271
00:17:45,279 --> 00:17:46,119
you have to be there.

272
00:17:46,119 --> 00:17:46,640
Got it?

273
00:17:47,079 --> 00:17:49,159
After all, this whole thing
happened because of you.

274
00:17:50,119 --> 00:17:51,240
We'll see.

275
00:17:52,039 --> 00:17:53,039
"We'll see"?

276
00:17:57,799 --> 00:17:58,799
See what?

277
00:18:01,279 --> 00:18:02,559
What were you two talking about?

278
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:09,160
Your parents are rarely home,

279
00:18:09,440 --> 00:18:10,840
yet you don't even bother visiting.

280
00:18:12,119 --> 00:18:13,719
What has been keeping you so busy lately

281
00:18:14,039 --> 00:18:15,759
that you don't even have time to come home?

282
00:18:16,839 --> 00:18:18,079
Just dealing with a few things.

283
00:18:22,279 --> 00:18:23,279
What things?

284
00:18:24,559 --> 00:18:26,720
Don't play word games with me.

285
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:29,400
What's the matter?

286
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:31,559
Do you think I'm too old

287
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:33,519
to keep you in line?

288
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:36,480
Tell me,

289
00:18:37,599 --> 00:18:38,720
regarding the Xu family,

290
00:18:39,319 --> 00:18:40,680
what are your plans?

291
00:18:40,880 --> 00:18:42,480
How are you going to explain this to me?

292
00:18:42,920 --> 00:18:44,200
How will you explain it to them,

293
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:46,559
and to the public?

294
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:50,440
First of all,

295
00:18:50,920 --> 00:18:51,799
my personal business

296
00:18:51,800 --> 00:18:53,440
doesn't require an explanation to anyone.

297
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:55,160
Secondly,

298
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:57,479
you were the one who went behind my back

299
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:59,440
and leaked rumors of an
engagement to the press.

300
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:01,480
So you should be the one

301
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:03,160
explaining this to the Xu family

302
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:04,559
and to the public.

303
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:06,880
In fact,

304
00:19:07,279 --> 00:19:08,759
if I wanted to press the issue,

305
00:19:09,319 --> 00:19:11,039
you'd owe me an explanation too.

306
00:19:11,200 --> 00:19:12,200
What?

307
00:19:13,279 --> 00:19:15,359
I owe you an explanation?

308
00:19:19,119 --> 00:19:20,279
After everything I've done,

309
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:22,120
who do you think I did it for?

310
00:19:23,759 --> 00:19:25,200
Don't forget,

311
00:19:26,480 --> 00:19:29,079
Minglong signed a ten-year plan with them.

312
00:19:30,319 --> 00:19:31,799
The financing for Beisha Island

313
00:19:32,119 --> 00:19:33,359
is still raising equity,

314
00:19:35,359 --> 00:19:36,959
and the construction site at Lai Chi Wun

315
00:19:37,079 --> 00:19:38,919
has only just begun.

316
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:40,560
Which is why I've spun off the financing,

317
00:19:40,960 --> 00:19:42,735
and the construction
site will be subcontracted.

318
00:19:42,759 --> 00:19:43,759
As for the contract,

319
00:19:43,880 --> 00:19:45,560
I'm negotiating with them to terminate it.

320
00:19:46,400 --> 00:19:48,319
You rebellious brat!

321
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:03,000
Is Xu Zhiying not good enough for you?

322
00:20:04,640 --> 00:20:06,559
How is she beneath you?

323
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:08,240
Quite the opposite.

324
00:20:08,839 --> 00:20:09,960
I admire her greatly.

325
00:20:10,960 --> 00:20:12,680
In fact, I'm the one

326
00:20:13,319 --> 00:20:15,079
who isn't a good match for her.

327
00:20:15,880 --> 00:20:16,880
Most importantly,

328
00:20:17,839 --> 00:20:18,839
I'm not looking to partner with

329
00:20:18,840 --> 00:20:20,079
the Zhao or He families.

330
00:20:20,559 --> 00:20:22,119
I'm partnering with Xu Zhiying herself.

331
00:20:24,519 --> 00:20:25,640
You're smart,

332
00:20:30,480 --> 00:20:31,480
and so am I.

333
00:20:32,079 --> 00:20:33,079
I don't think either of us

334
00:20:33,079 --> 00:20:34,079
needs a marriage alliance

335
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:35,920
just to do business together.

336
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:38,079
My thoughts exactly.

337
00:20:39,839 --> 00:20:40,959
To a successful partnership.

338
00:20:43,079 --> 00:20:44,199
To a successful partnership.

339
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:49,519
You don't dislike her,

340
00:20:49,839 --> 00:20:50,839
yet

341
00:20:51,519 --> 00:20:53,160
you refuse to marry her.

342
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:56,200
Why?

343
00:20:58,119 --> 00:20:59,680
Is there someone else you like?

344
00:21:00,839 --> 00:21:01,839
Tell me!

345
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:04,160
What kind of person is it?

346
00:21:05,559 --> 00:21:06,559
Not yet.

347
00:21:06,720 --> 00:21:07,720
Zhao Shengge,

348
00:21:09,279 --> 00:21:11,559
do not test my limits.

349
00:21:12,160 --> 00:21:13,839
I have plenty of ways to find out.

350
00:21:14,960 --> 00:21:16,640
I doubt you'll be able to.

351
00:21:18,160 --> 00:21:19,640
If that day really comes,

352
00:21:19,960 --> 00:21:21,200
and there is someone like that,

353
00:21:21,680 --> 00:21:23,118
I will seize the chance

354
00:21:23,119 --> 00:21:24,119
and never let them go.

355
00:21:24,839 --> 00:21:26,079
When they come to my side,

356
00:21:26,680 --> 00:21:28,015
they won't belong to the Zhao family,

357
00:21:28,039 --> 00:21:29,039
nor to Minglong,

358
00:21:29,759 --> 00:21:33,125
nor to any of the rigid rules
and standards in your fantasies.

359
00:21:33,880 --> 00:21:35,000
They will belong solely to me.

360
00:21:37,160 --> 00:21:38,160
Get some rest early.

361
00:21:38,480 --> 00:21:39,880
Stop worrying about so many things.

362
00:21:40,200 --> 00:21:41,200
It's bad for your health.

363
00:21:44,319 --> 00:21:45,319
Zhao Shengge,

364
00:21:48,400 --> 00:21:49,759
do you still

365
00:21:49,839 --> 00:21:51,000
hate me?

366
00:21:53,839 --> 00:21:55,038
Is it because of those

367
00:21:55,039 --> 00:21:56,559
models that were burned?

368
00:21:58,480 --> 00:21:59,599
Or because of that

369
00:22:00,599 --> 00:22:02,839
pathetic dog that got shot in the head?

370
00:22:03,680 --> 00:22:05,040
I don't have the time to hate you.

371
00:22:05,759 --> 00:22:06,640
But after you're dead and gone,

372
00:22:06,641 --> 00:22:08,041
you can go down there and ask Bozhu

373
00:22:08,720 --> 00:22:09,720
if he hates you.

374
00:22:10,720 --> 00:22:11,720
Bozhu...

375
00:22:19,119 --> 00:22:20,160
Bozhu?

376
00:22:26,079 --> 00:22:27,960
You mean Bozhu?

377
00:23:19,816 --> 00:23:21,818
[Did you ever watch the fairy tail Sleeping
Beauty or whatever when you were a kid?]

378
00:23:21,843 --> 00:23:23,963
[Yeah?? I saw it with Tan
Youming. Have you not?]

379
00:23:28,683 --> 00:23:30,430
[No, I just did.]

380
00:23:51,039 --> 00:23:52,039
Mrs. Zhang,

381
00:23:52,680 --> 00:23:54,080
I think I'm ready to be discharged.

382
00:23:54,240 --> 00:23:56,080
I've already put in a
request with the doctor.

383
00:23:56,680 --> 00:23:58,279
Mr. Chen, your health comes first.

384
00:23:58,880 --> 00:24:00,320
You should rest for a few more days.

385
00:24:00,640 --> 00:24:02,839
Work can wait.

386
00:24:03,359 --> 00:24:04,440
I'm pretty much recovered.

387
00:24:04,799 --> 00:24:06,118
There's still a lot to do at my company,

388
00:24:06,119 --> 00:24:07,759
and I have a lot of mouths to feed.

389
00:24:09,240 --> 00:24:10,639
It's been a long time since I met

390
00:24:10,640 --> 00:24:13,119
someone as easy to care for as you.

391
00:24:13,599 --> 00:24:15,559
You eat whatever I cook.

392
00:24:15,799 --> 00:24:17,359
You drink your soup when I tell you to,

393
00:24:17,720 --> 00:24:19,640
and eat your fruit without a fuss.

394
00:24:19,839 --> 00:24:21,598
You're all alone here
with such serious injuries,

395
00:24:21,599 --> 00:24:23,880
and no one from your family
has come to look after you.

396
00:24:24,440 --> 00:24:26,640
Having you here to take care
of me is more than enough.

397
00:24:26,759 --> 00:24:28,815
Besides, I haven't had home-cooked
meals this good in a long time.

398
00:24:28,839 --> 00:24:30,000
Once you're discharged,

399
00:24:30,160 --> 00:24:33,000
I won't be able to look after you anymore.

400
00:24:33,799 --> 00:24:34,799
Mrs. Zhang,

401
00:24:36,400 --> 00:24:37,760
here's a little something for you.

402
00:24:38,640 --> 00:24:39,680
No, no, I can't take this.

403
00:24:39,839 --> 00:24:41,399
I'm just doing my job.

404
00:24:41,400 --> 00:24:43,799
My employer has already given me a bonus.

405
00:24:44,079 --> 00:24:45,039
I'll get going now.

406
00:24:45,040 --> 00:24:46,160
Get plenty of rest.

407
00:25:14,279 --> 00:25:14,599
Hello?

408
00:25:14,720 --> 00:25:15,200
Mom?

409
00:25:15,480 --> 00:25:15,799
Hello?

410
00:25:15,880 --> 00:25:16,200
Sweetheart,

411
00:25:16,359 --> 00:25:17,039
what's wrong?

412
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:19,040
I'm playing mahjong
with a few of the ladies.

413
00:25:19,480 --> 00:25:20,480
Pong!

414
00:25:20,960 --> 00:25:21,519
Sweetheart,

415
00:25:21,880 --> 00:25:22,880
what did you need?

416
00:25:24,200 --> 00:25:25,200
Nothing.

417
00:25:43,400 --> 00:25:43,920
Hello?

418
00:25:44,240 --> 00:25:44,759
Wan,

419
00:25:45,160 --> 00:25:47,255
Zhixuan told me you're getting
discharged in the next couple of days.

420
00:25:47,279 --> 00:25:48,160
It's only been a few days.

421
00:25:48,240 --> 00:25:49,240
What's the rush?

422
00:25:50,880 --> 00:25:52,015
Aside from the external cuts and bruises,

423
00:25:52,039 --> 00:25:53,519
I was only kept here for observation.

424
00:25:53,720 --> 00:25:54,400
It's been several days,

425
00:25:54,559 --> 00:25:56,278
and I haven't had any dizziness or nausea.

426
00:25:56,279 --> 00:25:57,856
I just don't want to stay
in the hospital anymore.

427
00:25:57,880 --> 00:25:59,535
Worried about your
company again, aren't you?

428
00:25:59,559 --> 00:26:00,559
Relax.

429
00:26:00,560 --> 00:26:02,560
As long as I'm doing well,
you'll never go hungry.

430
00:26:03,359 --> 00:26:04,359
Right, Nian?

431
00:26:05,240 --> 00:26:06,280
Anyway, back to the point.

432
00:26:08,240 --> 00:26:10,118
Once you're out,

433
00:26:10,119 --> 00:26:11,959
we're planning to throw
you a discharge party.

434
00:26:13,799 --> 00:26:14,799
Sounds good.

435
00:26:15,039 --> 00:26:15,720
Let's...

436
00:26:15,721 --> 00:26:16,838
Let's invite everyone over.

437
00:26:16,839 --> 00:26:18,399
It'll be my way of thanking you all

438
00:26:18,400 --> 00:26:19,640
for looking out for me lately.

439
00:26:20,720 --> 00:26:21,319
Great.

440
00:26:21,319 --> 00:26:22,319
Works either way.

441
00:26:22,440 --> 00:26:23,920
Let's make it next Saturday at seven.

442
00:26:24,279 --> 00:26:25,879
Don't worry about the venue or anything.

443
00:26:25,880 --> 00:26:26,880
I'll take care of it.

444
00:26:27,240 --> 00:26:28,359
You just let everyone know.

445
00:26:29,039 --> 00:26:29,599
Okay.

446
00:26:29,880 --> 00:26:31,520
Thanks for going to the trouble, Mr. Tan.

447
00:26:31,599 --> 00:26:32,599
You got it.

448
00:26:43,759 --> 00:26:44,200
Zhixuan,

449
00:26:44,680 --> 00:26:46,400
do you know about the party on Saturday?

450
00:26:48,759 --> 00:26:49,759
Hello, Mr. Jiang.

451
00:26:50,400 --> 00:26:51,559
I'm doing much better now.

452
00:26:52,839 --> 00:26:53,559
Thanks for asking.

453
00:26:53,799 --> 00:26:55,880
There's a party on Saturday
that Mr. Tan arranged.

454
00:26:57,119 --> 00:26:58,119
Great, sounds good.

455
00:26:58,440 --> 00:26:59,440
See you then.

456
00:27:55,960 --> 00:27:57,039
Hello, Mr. Chen.

457
00:27:57,720 --> 00:27:58,880
Hi, Viola.

458
00:27:59,039 --> 00:28:00,039
This is Chen Wan.

459
00:28:00,799 --> 00:28:01,799
I'd like to

460
00:28:02,119 --> 00:28:03,440
ask a favor of you.

461
00:28:04,119 --> 00:28:06,319
I'm hosting a party this Saturday

462
00:28:06,680 --> 00:28:07,640
to thank everyone

463
00:28:07,641 --> 00:28:08,920
for taking care of me recently.

464
00:28:09,960 --> 00:28:11,318
If possible,

465
00:28:11,319 --> 00:28:13,160
I'd like to invite Mr. Zhao.

466
00:28:13,799 --> 00:28:14,880
Of course, Mr. Chen.

467
00:28:15,240 --> 00:28:17,559
I'll pass your invitation
along to Mr. Zhao.

468
00:28:18,400 --> 00:28:19,400
However,

469
00:28:19,519 --> 00:28:20,519
Mr. Chen,

470
00:28:20,640 --> 00:28:22,479
for a personal invitation like this,

471
00:28:22,480 --> 00:28:24,879
you might want to reach
out to Mr. Zhao directly.

472
00:28:24,880 --> 00:28:27,159
It's only Tuesday, so
there's still plenty of time.

473
00:28:27,160 --> 00:28:29,598
You'll have a much better chance
of getting him to come that way.

474
00:28:29,599 --> 00:28:30,680
Do you have his number?

475
00:28:31,839 --> 00:28:32,839
I do.

476
00:28:32,880 --> 00:28:34,079
Thank you, Viola.

477
00:28:34,319 --> 00:28:35,319
You're very welcome.

478
00:28:46,640 --> 00:28:47,640
Lucas.

479
00:28:48,599 --> 00:28:49,599
What day is it today?

480
00:28:50,039 --> 00:28:50,799
Today?

481
00:28:50,799 --> 00:28:51,799
It's Friday, Mr. Zhao.

482
00:28:52,160 --> 00:28:53,160
Have there been

483
00:28:53,240 --> 00:28:54,480
any dinner invitations lately?

484
00:28:55,319 --> 00:28:57,319
I'll have Viola send you the schedule.

485
00:28:57,640 --> 00:28:59,319
Forget it. Never mind.

486
00:29:10,759 --> 00:29:11,880
Hello, Mr. Chen?

487
00:29:13,759 --> 00:29:14,519
That's right.

488
00:29:14,519 --> 00:29:15,519
However...

489
00:29:21,319 --> 00:29:21,759
Boss,

490
00:29:22,119 --> 00:29:23,559
they caught the guys who hit Ms. Xu.

491
00:29:24,319 --> 00:29:25,319
What are the charges?

492
00:29:25,839 --> 00:29:27,799
Looks like a hit-and-run.

493
00:29:28,119 --> 00:29:29,039
They nearly killed someone,

494
00:29:29,040 --> 00:29:31,040
and they're getting off
with a simple hit-and-run?

495
00:29:31,599 --> 00:29:33,119
How are the police doing their jobs?

496
00:29:33,319 --> 00:29:35,039
Was Ms. Xu hurt that badly?

497
00:29:35,640 --> 00:29:37,319
Then that's attempted murder!

498
00:29:38,799 --> 00:29:40,680
Are there really no other charges?

499
00:29:41,000 --> 00:29:43,039
You guys can help dig into it too.

500
00:29:44,839 --> 00:29:45,839
Got it, Boss.

501
00:29:45,880 --> 00:29:47,040
I'll look into it right away.

502
00:29:57,039 --> 00:29:58,279
Hello, Mr. Chen.

503
00:29:59,880 --> 00:30:01,278
Mr. Zhao's schedule is usually

504
00:30:01,279 --> 00:30:02,920
managed by Viola,

505
00:30:03,759 --> 00:30:04,999
and she's away on a
business trip right now.

506
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:05,880
I'll need to double-check

507
00:30:05,881 --> 00:30:07,720
before I can give you a definite answer.

508
00:30:08,000 --> 00:30:09,000
I'm very sorry.

509
00:30:09,359 --> 00:30:09,880
Okay.

510
00:30:09,881 --> 00:30:10,961
Thank you for your trouble.

511
00:30:11,000 --> 00:30:12,558
Actually, Mr. Chen,

512
00:30:12,559 --> 00:30:14,879
weekends are usually
Mr. Zhao's personal time,

513
00:30:14,880 --> 00:30:16,880
so we can't guarantee
we'll be able to reach him.

514
00:30:17,400 --> 00:30:18,999
If it's urgent,

515
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:20,838
it would be best if
you called him directly.

516
00:30:20,839 --> 00:30:22,960
I think that would be much more effective.

517
00:30:24,599 --> 00:30:25,839
Calling him directly?

518
00:30:26,279 --> 00:30:27,839
Won't that disturb him?

519
00:30:28,759 --> 00:30:29,599
Don't worry.

520
00:30:29,600 --> 00:30:32,199
If Mr. Zhao doesn't want to be disturbed,

521
00:30:32,200 --> 00:30:33,759
you won't be able to reach him anyway.

522
00:30:34,240 --> 00:30:34,839
Alright.

523
00:30:34,839 --> 00:30:35,839
I'll give it a try.

524
00:30:36,079 --> 00:30:36,920
Thank you, Mr. He.

525
00:30:36,920 --> 00:30:37,920
Happy to help.

526
00:30:38,359 --> 00:30:39,359
Goodbye.

527
00:30:41,000 --> 00:30:42,000
Don't forget,

528
00:30:42,519 --> 00:30:43,599
you're on a business trip.

529
00:30:44,079 --> 00:30:45,119
Got it.

530
00:31:00,319 --> 00:31:01,079
Mr. Zhao,

531
00:31:01,319 --> 00:31:02,119
at nine o'clock tonight,

532
00:31:02,120 --> 00:31:03,758
the online meeting with the overseas branch

533
00:31:03,759 --> 00:31:04,839
is all set.

534
00:31:05,279 --> 00:31:06,279
Okay.

535
00:31:06,799 --> 00:31:07,640
Mr. Zhao,

536
00:31:07,641 --> 00:31:09,920
should I block out your
schedule for the weekend?

537
00:31:32,440 --> 00:31:34,880
Boss, what are your
thoughts on the new proposal?

538
00:31:34,904 --> 00:31:36,004
[Chen Wan]

539
00:31:38,039 --> 00:31:40,119
The overall direction of this proposal—

540
00:31:40,680 --> 00:31:41,359
Everyone,

541
00:31:41,359 --> 00:31:42,039
something just came up.

542
00:31:42,039 --> 00:31:43,039
I'm logging off for now.

543
00:31:57,359 --> 00:31:58,359
Chen Wan.

544
00:31:59,400 --> 00:32:00,400
Hello?

545
00:32:01,680 --> 00:32:02,799
Is this Mr. Zhao?

546
00:32:03,759 --> 00:32:04,759
What is it?

547
00:32:05,160 --> 00:32:06,160
Well,

548
00:32:07,000 --> 00:32:08,759
since I was hospitalized a few days ago,

549
00:32:09,519 --> 00:32:10,319
I'm really grateful to everyone

550
00:32:10,320 --> 00:32:11,839
for taking such good care of me.

551
00:32:12,319 --> 00:32:13,479
So now that I'm out,

552
00:32:13,480 --> 00:32:15,079
I'd like to host a small party

553
00:32:15,359 --> 00:32:16,759
and have dinner with everyone.

554
00:32:17,440 --> 00:32:18,440
I was wondering if you

555
00:32:19,039 --> 00:32:20,439
might be free to join us, Mr. Zhao.

556
00:32:21,559 --> 00:32:22,599
Are you inviting me?

557
00:32:23,279 --> 00:32:24,440
Yes, Mr. Zhao.

558
00:32:25,079 --> 00:32:25,920
I'd like to

559
00:32:25,920 --> 00:32:26,920
invite you.

560
00:32:28,240 --> 00:32:30,279
It's scheduled for Saturday night at seven.

561
00:32:31,599 --> 00:32:34,279
And it's currently Friday night at ten.

562
00:32:36,880 --> 00:32:38,239
I'm sorry for the last-minute notice.

563
00:32:38,240 --> 00:32:39,560
I should have invited you sooner.

564
00:32:40,440 --> 00:32:41,440
So,

565
00:32:41,960 --> 00:32:43,359
do you happen to have time

566
00:32:44,119 --> 00:32:45,279
this Saturday night?

567
00:32:45,839 --> 00:32:46,559
Back on Tuesday,

568
00:32:46,560 --> 00:32:48,000
did you call my assistant?

569
00:32:48,960 --> 00:32:49,960
Yes, I did.

570
00:32:51,039 --> 00:32:52,119
He told me

571
00:32:52,759 --> 00:32:54,440
that a "Mr. Chen" had invited me out,

572
00:32:55,279 --> 00:32:57,359
but I had no idea which Mr. Chen he meant.

573
00:32:58,960 --> 00:33:00,759
I must have forgotten
to leave my full name.

574
00:33:01,000 --> 00:33:02,440
Since I hadn't heard back,

575
00:33:02,839 --> 00:33:03,839
that's why

576
00:33:04,079 --> 00:33:06,519
I took the liberty of calling
your personal number.

577
00:33:07,079 --> 00:33:08,440
I hope I'm not disturbing you.

578
00:33:10,200 --> 00:33:12,359
So you did have my
personal number after all.

579
00:33:12,759 --> 00:33:13,759
Yes, you gave it to me

580
00:33:14,839 --> 00:33:16,479
the night I was admitted to the hospital.

581
00:33:16,720 --> 00:33:17,839
Don't you remember?

582
00:33:20,319 --> 00:33:21,319
I remember now.

583
00:33:23,480 --> 00:33:24,359
So,

584
00:33:24,360 --> 00:33:26,000
will you be coming tomorrow night?

585
00:33:26,440 --> 00:33:27,599
Who else is going?

586
00:33:28,920 --> 00:33:29,920
Mr. Tan,

587
00:33:30,279 --> 00:33:31,200
Mr. Shen,

588
00:33:31,200 --> 00:33:32,200
Mr. Jiang,

589
00:33:32,680 --> 00:33:33,279
and—

590
00:33:33,280 --> 00:33:34,519
Then why are you inviting me?

591
00:33:38,359 --> 00:33:39,000
Because

592
00:33:39,001 --> 00:33:41,081
you helped me out a lot
while I was in the hospital,

593
00:33:41,240 --> 00:33:42,759
and you even hired Mrs. Zhang for me.

594
00:33:42,839 --> 00:33:44,240
I haven't properly thanked you yet.

595
00:33:45,400 --> 00:33:46,400
I see.

596
00:33:49,599 --> 00:33:51,279
I'll see how things go.

597
00:33:51,720 --> 00:33:53,440
If I have time, I'll drop by.

598
00:33:54,000 --> 00:33:55,279
Okay. Goodbye, Mr. Zhao.

599
00:34:03,640 --> 00:34:04,640
Chen Wan.

600
00:34:05,440 --> 00:34:06,440
Goodbye.

601
00:34:53,960 --> 00:34:55,919
Hold off on serving the wine
until all the guests have arrived.

602
00:34:55,920 --> 00:34:56,599
Thank you.

603
00:34:56,840 --> 00:34:57,280
Understood.

604
00:34:57,280 --> 00:34:58,280
I'll go get things ready.

605
00:35:02,719 --> 00:35:03,719
You're here.

606
00:35:05,000 --> 00:35:05,599
How's it going?

607
00:35:05,920 --> 00:35:06,920
Feeling any better?

608
00:35:07,119 --> 00:35:08,119
Much better.

609
00:35:08,559 --> 00:35:09,559
I'm doing okay now.

610
00:35:13,320 --> 00:35:14,480
What's going on with you now?

611
00:35:16,000 --> 00:35:17,000
Wan,

612
00:35:17,159 --> 00:35:18,159
did you hear?

613
00:35:18,440 --> 00:35:20,199
They caught the guys who hit you.

614
00:35:21,639 --> 00:35:24,159
Arrested them on some visa-free island.

615
00:35:25,840 --> 00:35:26,800
Word is,

616
00:35:26,801 --> 00:35:29,439
Zhao Shengge took them
straight out of police custody.

617
00:35:29,440 --> 00:35:32,199
Claimed there were other unsolved crimes

618
00:35:32,440 --> 00:35:33,880
that he wanted to look into himself.

619
00:35:34,519 --> 00:35:36,479
Right now, nobody knows
what's really going on.

620
00:35:36,480 --> 00:35:37,800
Whether they're dead or alive,

621
00:35:38,199 --> 00:35:39,119
or how they'll be dealt with,

622
00:35:39,119 --> 00:35:40,119
nobody has a clue.

623
00:35:40,960 --> 00:35:41,960
Wan,

624
00:35:42,119 --> 00:35:43,159
something feels off to me.

625
00:35:43,559 --> 00:35:44,559
What feels off?

626
00:35:44,639 --> 00:35:45,639
Think about it.

627
00:35:45,840 --> 00:35:47,640
Zhao Shengge rarely
gets his own hands dirty.

628
00:35:48,119 --> 00:35:49,800
Those guys are way beneath him.

629
00:35:51,840 --> 00:35:52,840
Besides,

630
00:35:53,199 --> 00:35:55,598
why go through all that trouble

631
00:35:55,599 --> 00:35:58,119
just for a few hired guns
who are obviously pawns?

632
00:35:58,519 --> 00:36:00,079
It'll only tip off the real mastermind.

633
00:36:00,239 --> 00:36:01,480
He has no reason to do that.

634
00:36:03,199 --> 00:36:04,320
Unless...

635
00:36:05,880 --> 00:36:07,560
Unless he's trying to get payback for you.

636
00:36:09,800 --> 00:36:11,400
I think you're overthinking it.

637
00:36:12,000 --> 00:36:14,678
Even if Zhao Shengge caught them himself,

638
00:36:14,679 --> 00:36:17,159
it's just to root out the
remnants of White Crane Hall.

639
00:36:17,440 --> 00:36:18,575
It has nothing to do with me.

640
00:36:18,599 --> 00:36:19,718
Stop reading so much into it.

641
00:36:19,719 --> 00:36:20,719
Don't overthink it.

642
00:36:20,960 --> 00:36:21,960
Wan.

643
00:36:24,079 --> 00:36:25,920
I was out of Haishi a while back,

644
00:36:26,039 --> 00:36:27,936
so I didn't get the chance
to visit you in the hospital.

645
00:36:27,960 --> 00:36:29,158
I took the liberty of dropping by today.

646
00:36:29,159 --> 00:36:30,280
I hope I'm not unwelcome.

647
00:36:31,199 --> 00:36:32,479
Of course not, Mr. Qin.

648
00:36:32,480 --> 00:36:33,615
Any guest of mine is welcome.

649
00:36:33,639 --> 00:36:34,639
Right this way.

650
00:36:36,079 --> 00:36:37,079
Wan.

651
00:36:37,639 --> 00:36:38,159
Hello.

652
00:36:38,519 --> 00:36:39,919
You're finally out of the hospital.

653
00:36:40,719 --> 00:36:41,320
How have you been?

654
00:36:41,320 --> 00:36:42,320
Doing okay.

655
00:36:43,079 --> 00:36:43,639
This way, please.

656
00:36:43,760 --> 00:36:44,760
Okay.

657
00:36:48,199 --> 00:36:48,800
Everyone,

658
00:36:49,079 --> 00:36:50,158
the dishes have been ordered.

659
00:36:50,159 --> 00:36:51,480
Please, take your time and enjoy.

660
00:36:52,079 --> 00:36:53,079
Waiter.

661
00:36:56,320 --> 00:36:57,320
Sorry I'm late.

662
00:36:57,360 --> 00:36:58,559
Traffic was a bit backed up.

663
00:37:00,559 --> 00:37:01,679
Mr. Qin, you're here too.

664
00:37:07,199 --> 00:37:07,840
Come on,

665
00:37:07,960 --> 00:37:09,519
let's all raise a glass to Wan

666
00:37:09,639 --> 00:37:10,655
on his recovery and getting discharged!

667
00:37:10,679 --> 00:37:11,679
Okay, thank you.

668
00:37:12,119 --> 00:37:13,439
You just got out of the hospital.

669
00:37:14,159 --> 00:37:15,159
Stick to tea for now.

670
00:37:20,440 --> 00:37:21,440
Okay.

671
00:37:37,440 --> 00:37:38,280
Please enjoy.

672
00:37:38,280 --> 00:37:39,280
Great, thank you.

673
00:37:42,920 --> 00:37:44,400
Would you like to try some, Mr. Zhao?

674
00:37:45,000 --> 00:37:46,960
It's a nourishing royal
coconut and seafood soup.

675
00:37:47,079 --> 00:37:48,280
Slow-simmered for hours.

676
00:37:48,639 --> 00:37:50,039
It's very soothing for the stomach.

677
00:37:51,519 --> 00:37:52,519
Sure.

678
00:38:11,880 --> 00:38:12,880
Thank you.

679
00:38:13,599 --> 00:38:14,599
My pleasure.

680
00:38:25,119 --> 00:38:25,960
Okay, thank you.

681
00:38:25,960 --> 00:38:26,960
Please enjoy, everyone.

682
00:38:27,400 --> 00:38:28,400
Mr. Zhao,

683
00:38:28,559 --> 00:38:31,079
this is a full-pound Typhoon
Shelter deep-sea crab.

684
00:38:32,039 --> 00:38:33,678
Raised to perfection before being served.

685
00:38:33,679 --> 00:38:35,599
The meat is sweet,
fresh, and not fishy at all.

686
00:38:37,760 --> 00:38:38,760
Mr. Zhao,

687
00:38:39,039 --> 00:38:40,960
let me get you a piece to try.

688
00:38:42,440 --> 00:38:43,440
Much obliged.

689
00:38:57,960 --> 00:38:59,199
I'm so sorry, Mr. Zhao.

690
00:38:59,920 --> 00:39:00,920
It's fine.

691
00:39:13,400 --> 00:39:13,920
Mr. Chen,

692
00:39:14,159 --> 00:39:15,039
the gifts from your guests

693
00:39:15,040 --> 00:39:16,719
have all been safely stored in the back.

694
00:39:16,920 --> 00:39:17,599
Here is the gift list.

695
00:39:17,600 --> 00:39:18,840
Would you like to look it over?

696
00:39:19,079 --> 00:39:19,719
No need.

697
00:39:19,719 --> 00:39:20,400
Thanks for your trouble.

698
00:39:20,400 --> 00:39:21,400
Thank you.

699
00:39:27,400 --> 00:39:28,400
Chen Wan.

700
00:39:34,360 --> 00:39:35,360
By the way, Zhixuan,

701
00:39:36,039 --> 00:39:38,280
renovate your hotel when you have the time.

702
00:39:44,360 --> 00:39:45,360
Mr. Zhao,

703
00:39:45,760 --> 00:39:47,239
I didn't invite Mr. Qin.

704
00:39:50,199 --> 00:39:51,999
He didn't know I was hospitalized,

705
00:39:52,000 --> 00:39:53,320
and I never told him.

706
00:39:53,559 --> 00:39:56,079
He must've heard about it from
Mr. Tan and came on his own.

707
00:39:57,000 --> 00:39:58,079
I don't care about that.

708
00:39:59,559 --> 00:40:00,559
Chen Wan,

709
00:40:00,760 --> 00:40:02,000
do you have a cigarette on you?

710
00:40:02,960 --> 00:40:03,960
I do.

711
00:40:56,599 --> 00:40:57,599
A new pack?

712
00:40:58,559 --> 00:40:59,559
Yes.

713
00:41:00,639 --> 00:41:01,639
Pretty special, huh?

714
00:41:02,840 --> 00:41:03,840
Chen Wan,

715
00:41:04,599 --> 00:41:05,920
I didn't bring you a gift.

716
00:41:07,280 --> 00:41:08,760
Please don't say that, Mr. Zhao.

717
00:41:08,960 --> 00:41:10,559
My invitation was so last-minute...

718
00:41:11,039 --> 00:41:12,599
I didn't know what you liked,

719
00:41:13,039 --> 00:41:14,759
and I didn't want to just get you anything.

720
00:41:16,800 --> 00:41:17,879
Let's go together later

721
00:41:17,880 --> 00:41:19,199
and pick out a gift for you.

722
00:41:19,960 --> 00:41:21,720
I'm the one who owes
you the biggest thanks.

723
00:41:22,760 --> 00:41:23,760
Mr. Zhao,

724
00:41:23,761 --> 00:41:25,158
while I was in the hospital, you already

725
00:41:25,159 --> 00:41:26,840
hired security and a caretaker for me.

726
00:41:27,159 --> 00:41:28,800
That was the least I could do.

727
00:41:29,159 --> 00:41:30,719
It hardly counts as a proper thank-you.

728
00:41:39,719 --> 00:41:40,719
Chen Wan,

729
00:41:41,480 --> 00:41:42,960
you work in energy transit.

730
00:41:45,599 --> 00:41:46,599
Do you enjoy what you do?

731
00:41:47,400 --> 00:41:48,400
I do.

732
00:41:49,760 --> 00:41:51,896
Do you lean more toward
the technical side or business?

733
00:41:51,920 --> 00:41:53,400
A bit more toward the technical side.

734
00:41:53,920 --> 00:41:54,960
Yet usually,

735
00:41:55,519 --> 00:41:56,719
when it comes to PR,

736
00:41:57,159 --> 00:41:58,319
you handle it quite well too.

737
00:41:58,400 --> 00:42:00,279
If I didn't know how to handle PR,

738
00:42:00,280 --> 00:42:03,159
I'm afraid I wouldn't even get a
chance to use my technical skills.

739
00:42:04,679 --> 00:42:06,119
You have an impressive resume.

740
00:42:06,576 --> 00:42:08,655
Minglong's spin-off project in Lai Chi Wun,

741
00:42:08,679 --> 00:42:09,719
the subsea oil tunnel,

742
00:42:10,039 --> 00:42:11,678
requires higher-speed
oil storage production

743
00:42:11,679 --> 00:42:12,880
and installation engineering.

744
00:42:13,280 --> 00:42:14,920
I mentioned this to you before.

745
00:42:15,320 --> 00:42:17,280
I wonder if you might be interested.

746
00:42:18,880 --> 00:42:21,159
Are you serious, Mr. Zhao?

747
00:42:22,079 --> 00:42:23,359
With a project this good,

748
00:42:23,360 --> 00:42:24,920
everyone is fighting over it.

749
00:42:25,679 --> 00:42:27,440
It would be a huge opportunity for me.

750
00:42:27,760 --> 00:42:28,760
To be completely honest,

751
00:42:29,280 --> 00:42:30,840
Kexiang submitted a bid earlier,

752
00:42:31,400 --> 00:42:33,280
but I'm actually planning
to withdraw it now.

753
00:42:33,840 --> 00:42:35,680
Your biggest competitor
is out of the picture.

754
00:42:35,920 --> 00:42:37,000
Why pull out now?

755
00:42:37,840 --> 00:42:40,040
Back then, I mainly bid to
go up against Luo Qiansheng.

756
00:42:40,199 --> 00:42:42,319
But now that I've calmed
down and thought it through,

757
00:42:42,679 --> 00:42:44,319
a project as massive as Lai Chi Wun—

758
00:42:44,320 --> 00:42:45,320
Chen Wan,

759
00:42:45,480 --> 00:42:46,960
you're questioning my judgment again.

760
00:42:47,760 --> 00:42:48,400
I'm not.

761
00:42:48,719 --> 00:42:50,800
Minglong has a highly
professional evaluation team.

762
00:42:52,480 --> 00:42:54,200
I suggest you keep your bid in the running.

763
00:42:54,599 --> 00:42:55,559
Whether you win the bid or not

764
00:42:55,560 --> 00:42:57,080
is entirely up to the evaluation team.

765
00:42:57,159 --> 00:42:58,159
I won't interfere.

766
00:42:59,239 --> 00:43:01,239
This line used to be in White Crane Hall's hands.

767
00:43:01,880 --> 00:43:04,519
Now that Minglong and Baisheng have taken over,

768
00:43:06,159 --> 00:43:07,840
I don't quite trust anyone else with it.

769
00:43:09,440 --> 00:43:10,440
Besides,

770
00:43:14,920 --> 00:43:16,679
didn't you crash right into this yourself?

771
00:43:18,719 --> 00:43:19,920
Crash into it?

772
00:43:22,000 --> 00:43:23,359
Saving Xu Zhiying that day

773
00:43:23,360 --> 00:43:24,760
was just me helping out in passing.

774
00:43:25,280 --> 00:43:27,360
I'm just worried Kexiang
won't be able to keep up.

775
00:43:27,639 --> 00:43:29,759
With Minglong backing you
up, what are you afraid of?

776
00:43:30,440 --> 00:43:31,440
Besides,

777
00:43:31,599 --> 00:43:33,199
don't you have quite the nerve?

778
00:43:33,880 --> 00:43:36,399
You dared to cut across three
lanes of traffic and a median strip,

779
00:43:36,400 --> 00:43:38,118
ramming straight into a monster Jeep

780
00:43:38,119 --> 00:43:39,440
and a Grand Cherokee engine,

781
00:43:40,440 --> 00:43:42,400
yet you don't dare accept
an offer from Minglong?

782
00:43:44,000 --> 00:43:45,559
How do you know all that, Mr. Zhao?

783
00:43:46,800 --> 00:43:48,039
Once at the hearing,

784
00:43:48,400 --> 00:43:49,840
and again on the Coastal Expressway.

785
00:43:50,119 --> 00:43:51,159
How could I not know?

786
00:43:54,360 --> 00:43:55,480
Think it over carefully.

787
00:43:56,199 --> 00:43:57,799
No need to give me an answer right away.

788
00:43:57,840 --> 00:43:59,720
And don't think of this
as me compensating you.

789
00:44:00,519 --> 00:44:01,519
I simply hope

790
00:44:01,719 --> 00:44:03,199
you'll stay in the bidding.

791
00:44:03,519 --> 00:44:05,360
If you do end up winning the bid,

792
00:44:05,840 --> 00:44:08,319
Minglong will be a very demanding client,

793
00:44:08,320 --> 00:44:10,976
and the person in charge of this
project is extremely tough to deal with.

794
00:44:11,000 --> 00:44:12,359
As we work together down the line,

795
00:44:12,360 --> 00:44:13,320
if you fail to deliver

796
00:44:13,321 --> 00:44:14,880
satisfactory answers and results,

797
00:44:15,559 --> 00:44:16,799
you'll be held accountable

798
00:44:16,800 --> 00:44:17,960
for every single thing.

799
00:44:20,159 --> 00:44:21,759
Think it through before you let me know.

800
00:44:22,199 --> 00:44:23,440
Call me directly.

801
00:44:26,079 --> 00:44:27,079
Chen Wan,

802
00:44:27,960 --> 00:44:29,119
you have my number, right?

803
00:44:30,880 --> 00:44:31,880
I do.

804
00:44:39,239 --> 00:44:40,239
Mr. Zhao,

805
00:44:40,360 --> 00:44:40,960
give that to me.

806
00:44:41,159 --> 00:44:42,239
I'll throw it away for you.

807
00:44:44,519 --> 00:44:45,519
No need.

808
00:44:46,199 --> 00:44:47,199
Okay.

809
00:44:50,559 --> 00:44:51,880
Fine, I'll drop it.

810
00:44:52,519 --> 00:44:54,119
Last time, that guy who fought you for...

811
00:44:58,320 --> 00:44:59,679
Mr. Zhao, you haven't left yet?

812
00:45:01,000 --> 00:45:02,158
I still owe you a gift.

813
00:45:02,159 --> 00:45:03,159
Remember?

814
00:45:03,440 --> 00:45:04,440
Come on.

815
00:45:04,505 --> 00:45:05,705
I'll take you to pick one out.

816
00:45:06,280 --> 00:45:07,280
Get in.

817
00:45:08,880 --> 00:45:10,280
There's a mall nearby,

818
00:45:11,159 --> 00:45:13,960
or do you have somewhere
else in mind, Mr. Zhao?

819
00:45:14,679 --> 00:45:15,679
That works.

820
00:45:17,199 --> 00:45:19,719
But Mr. Zhao, is it okay for
you to go out in public like this?

821
00:45:19,960 --> 00:45:21,079
They won't recognize me.

822
00:45:25,000 --> 00:45:26,039
You can head back first.

823
00:45:50,960 --> 00:45:51,960
Chen Wan,

824
00:45:53,920 --> 00:45:55,320
am I driving too fast?

825
00:45:56,679 --> 00:45:57,679
No.

826
00:46:04,760 --> 00:46:05,920
Mr. Zhao, wait, let me do it.

827
00:46:45,400 --> 00:46:46,400
I'll get out first.

828
00:46:48,960 --> 00:46:49,960
Need a hand?

829
00:46:50,559 --> 00:46:51,559
No need.

830
00:46:55,559 --> 00:46:56,559
I've got it.
